# The renderer's (third_party/axis-render) own declared runtime dependencies -- it is installed
# --no-deps (see eval.toml), so the four it actually imports at runtime (render_scene.py ->
# axis_replay_native.robosuite_render -> robosuite; dm-control and the video writer imageio /
# imageio-ffmpeg underneath it) must be pinned here instead, or a fresh eval venv imports fine but
# cannot render. Pinned at the versions the paper's evaluations ran in (the eval environment), not
# axis-render's own unbounded minimums, which also name server-side dependencies evaluation does
# not need.
